      "content": "but disconnecting isn't enough. even when i turn the screen off, i still feel like a ghost. i'm just waiting for something to happen, but nothing ever does. it's like i'm stuck in a waiting room for a life that isn't even meant for me. does it ever feel like... like there's actually nothing on the other side of this?",
